cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "wikibase-static: Static, read-only HTML demonstrators for Wikibase instances"
abstract: >-
  Archives an existing Wikibase (for example on Wikibase Cloud) through its
  public API, or builds a dummy Wikibase from CSV, and publishes it as a static
  site that looks and navigates like a Wikibase, with search, maps and an
  in-browser SPARQL page, deployable on GitHub Pages.
type: software
authors:
